  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々、お疲れ様\r\n今日はどうだった？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "…………",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "摩美々？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "あ────\r\nはいー……ぼちぼちでしたねー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、いつも頑張ってくれて嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "別に頑張ってるわけじゃないですケド……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサーにも恩を売っておきたいんでー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それってつまり……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "見返り、期待してますんでー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ま、まぁ、そういうことだよな……ははは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010140,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "プロデューサーからしたら\r\n私はいつも頑張ってるみたいなんでー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010150,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "その分のボーナスも楽しみですねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、わかったよ\r\n俺も頑張らないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010160,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふふー",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、実際こうして摩美々が頑張ってくれてるおかげで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色んなところに摩美々の魅力が伝わっていて\r\n俺も嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010170,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "色んなところ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は摩美々に、今度の生放送特番に出演しないかって\r\nオファーがあったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010180,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "特番ですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、マジシャンたちのマジックを\r\n体験しようっていう内容の番組なんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2005018010190,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ふーん……つまり、マジックショーを見て\r\nびっくりしてる人の画がほしいってことですねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200501801/2005018010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、まぁそういう狙いもあるかもしれないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
